  "notes": [
    "The archived original instruction matches its main-branch blob byte-for-byte.",
    "Runtime changes apply to M1A2_1998, T80U_1989 and the listed existing game ammunition. Kontakt-1 and unregistered munition families were exercised in policy tests.",
